description:
Plugin configurations as a JSON object. Each key is a plugin name, and the value is that plugin's configuration object.

Example:
```json
{
  "limit-count": {
    "count": 100,
    "time_window": 60
  },
  "key-auth": {}
}
```

See the [Plugin Hub](https://apisix.apache.org/plugins/) for available plugins and their schemas.
